          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Typical US ranges:</strong> walking pads about $200-$600, budget
            folding treadmills $400-$900, mid-range $1,000-$2,000, premium $2,000-$4,000 and
            commercial $4,000-$10,000+. Most regular home runners land in the mid-range, where
            durable motors, running-length decks and long warranties arrive together.
